  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#036;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">Mo' Blocks Mod</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#036\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">为《我的世界》添加了更多方块，并加入了原版无法合成的方块的合成配方。本模组添加了彩色砖块和橡木，以及彩色的橡木台阶、楼梯、栅栏、彩色砖台阶和墙。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#f00\">*重要提示* 截至2021年2月17日，Mo' Blocks Mod 的 1.12.2 游戏版本存在一个问题，导致您无法合成任何台阶。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">Mo' Blocks Mod - 方块</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">彩色橡木木板、楼梯、栅栏和台阶</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">彩色砖块、砖台阶和砖墙</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">透明玻璃</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">羊毛台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">暗岩、暗岩台阶、磨制暗岩、磨制暗岩台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">陶土台阶（全色系）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">釉陶台阶（全色系）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">彩色萤石</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">混凝土台阶和混凝土墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">末地石台阶、楼梯和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">泥土台阶和楼梯</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">橡木原木台阶和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">白桦木原木台阶和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">云杉木原木台阶和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">金合欢木原木台阶和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">深色橡木原木台阶和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">丛林木原木台阶和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">去皮橡木原木台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">去皮白桦木原木台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">去皮云杉木原木台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">去皮金合欢木原木台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">去皮深色橡木原木台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">去皮丛林木原木台阶</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">Mo' Blocks Mod - 物品</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">漂白水瓶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">染料清洁剂瓶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">彩色萤石粉</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Mo' Blocks Mod - 合成配方（原版方块）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">蜘蛛网合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>9 线</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">红蘑菇方块合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>4 红蘑菇</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">棕蘑菇方块合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>4 棕蘑菇</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">菌丝体合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>8 个红蘑菇或棕蘑菇，以及 1 个草方块</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Mo' Blocks Mod - 合成配方（模组方块）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">彩色橡木木板合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>8 个橡木木板和 1 个任意染料</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">彩色砖块合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>8 个砖块和 1 个任意染料</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">透明玻璃合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>熔炼玻璃</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">暗岩合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>8 个石头和 1 个灰色染料</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">彩色萤石合成配方 -</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>8 个萤石块和 1 个任意染料</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
